<title>USA: Bentley Pharmaceutical seeks acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Bentley Pharmaceutical seeks acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bentley Pharmaceuticals Inc said Monday it signed an agreement with Plexus Ventures Inc to supplement ongoing activities for identifying acquisitions.</p>
<p>Plexus Ventures will search for products and companies that can contribute to Bentley's revenue and profits in the U.S. and in targeted European markets.</p>
<p>Plexus Ventures, headquartered in Blue Bell, Pa., was founded in 1990 by John F. Chappell, who had a 28-year career with SmithKline Beecham Plc, where he most recently served as chairman of SKB's Worldwide Pharmaceuticals Division. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
